; The module half of the expansion-backtrace case (490): a macro whose
; template calls an undefined name, and one that invokes it, so a
; single diagnostic carries one frame and, through the second, two -
; outermost first. Both exported; the fixture's errors are the
; CHECKER's, arising inside the expansions.
(pub macro (frameBad x) (noSuchFn x))

(pub macro (frameOuter x) (frameBad x))
